{"id":"eaa0de797e94fa6b","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-uniform-circuit-family.md","title":"Logspace-Uniform Circuits","display":"df-uniform-circuit-family — Logspace-Uniform Circuits","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-uniform-circuit-family","aliases":["28-df-uniform-circuit-family","Logspace-Uniform Circuit Family"],"display":"df-uniform-circuit-family — Logspace-Uniform Circuits","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-l]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.14","source_printed_pages":"112","source_pdf_pages":"138","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-uniform-circuit-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-uniform-circuit-family</span><span>Logspace-Uniform Circuit Family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-uniform-circuit-family — Logspace-Uniform Circuits"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e145640be927aa76\" href=\"?note=e145640be927aa76\" title=\"28-df-l\">28-df-l</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.14"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"112"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"138"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\">\\(\\mathcal C=(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\)</span>；电路结构与规范编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{desc}\">\\(\\operatorname{desc}\\)</span> 在下式定义为该编码在单输出电路上的限制。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e145640be927aa76\" href=\"?note=e145640be927aa76\" title=\"28-df-l\">28-df-l</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\{1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(G:\\{1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；字符串下标从一开始，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(i)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\)</span> 为正整数标准二进制编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\Sigma\">\\(b\\in\\Sigma\\)</span> 与单字符字串认同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{LU}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{LU}}\\)</span> 为下式固定的三元组编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{desc}(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C)\\qquad(C\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{desc}(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C)\\qquad(C\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{LU}}(u,v,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(v,b))\\qquad(u,v\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ b\\in\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{LU}}(u,v,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(v,b))\\qquad(u,v\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ b\\in\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_G\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{LU}}(1^n,\\operatorname{bin}(i),b):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ 1\\le i\\le|G(1^n)|,\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ G(1^n)_i=b\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_G\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{LU}}(1^n,\\operatorname{bin}(i),b):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ 1\\le i\\le|G(1^n)|,\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ G(1^n)_i=b\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LU}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists G:\\{1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ [L_G\\in\\mathbf L\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (G(1^n)=\\operatorname{desc}(C_n)\\land|G(1^n)|\\le c(n+1)^a)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LU}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists G:\\{1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ [L_G\\in\\mathbf L\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (G(1^n)=\\operatorname{desc}(C_n)\\land|G(1^n)|\\le c(n+1)^a)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>显式多项式输出长度界阻止将指数长描述与其局部比特查询混淆。本定义只要求描述的比特查询语言属于对数空间类；若用不计只写输出带的转写器，则可逐位写出整段描述。不能在本目录把输出带计入空间的机器模型下，将多项式长完整输出本身说成只占对数空间。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.14，印刷页 112；PDF 页 138。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-l","status":"resolved","id":"e145640be927aa76","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-l]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}$；电路结构与规范编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]。$\\operatorname{desc}$ 在下式定义为该编码在单输出电路上的限制。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-l","status":"resolved","id":"e145640be927aa76","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ 见 [[28-df-l]]；$G:\\{1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*$；字符串下标从一开始，$\\operatorname{bin}(i)$ 为正整数标准二进制编码。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]，$b\\in\\Sigma$ 与单字符字串认同。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{LU}}$ 为下式固定的三元组编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{desc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\{1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{LU}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{desc}(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C)\\qquad(C\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{LU}}(u,v,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(v,b))\\qquad(u,v\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ b\\in\\Sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"L_G\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{LU}}(1^n,\\operatorname{bin}(i),b):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ 1\\le i\\le|G(1^n)|,\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\},\\ G(1^n)_i=b\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LU}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists G:\\{1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ [L_G\\in\\mathbf L\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (G(1^n)=\\operatorname{desc}(C_n)\\land|G(1^n)|\\le c(n+1)^a)].","display":true}],"bytes":2441,"backlinks":[{"id":"17518c2952ef83e1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NC}^k$、$\\operatorname{BF}$ 与电路参数见 [[28-df-nc]]；$\\operatorname{LU}$ 见 [[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"一致性与电路类：[[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]、[[28-df-nc]]、[[28-df-nc1]]、[[28-df-ac0]]、[[28-df-tc0]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","e145640be927aa76","0dfeff4bd5d69b86"]}